    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "f8b0145e-b999-47b5-a00f-a68dfd974eb2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotels on full board basis\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; entrance fees included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional tour manager\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Shanghai\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll internal flights in China\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in China\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 15 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOptional Yangtze River Cruise\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInternal flights\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4 nights full board\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThree Gorges Dam Project\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELesser Three Gorges\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "aa9defc2-bd30-4e53-acd0-4c8c7280750c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EGood quality 4* hotels on full board basis dining in the hotel or local restaurants:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECall us for a costing for 5* hotels for this tour\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "70bfd193-72d9-4de5-af33-594644040591",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EShanghai city tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EShanghai Chinese acrobatics show\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFull day Beijing city tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETiananmen Square\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EForbidden City\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESummer Palace\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBeijing opera show\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGreat Wall of China\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMing Tomb Museum\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPeking duck banquet\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETemple of Heaven\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EXian\u2019s ancient city walls\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETerracotta Warriors of Qin Shi Huang\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGreat Wild Goose Pagoda\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EImperial Dumpling Banquet \u0026amp; Dynasty Stage Show\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "42dd3d02-f2b1-4629-bd94-ae019acf1905",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ERemember that this tour is just our suggestion to provide inspiration and whet your appetite. Every one of our tours is tailor made exclusively for your group and your group alone. So if you like the look of this tour but want to alter it to suit your group, that\u2019s fine. Tell us how you want to change it and we\u2019ll send you a proposal that meets the exact requirements for your group tour. Then, combining our experience with your understanding of the profile and interests of your members, together we can fine tune the itinerary so that you get the perfect tour at the right price for your group.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "301c64a4-dd7b-4f0b-a02c-d6bce62ee477",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003ENB: B - Breakfast, L - Lunch, D - Dinner\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Depart for Shanghai\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Shanghai.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Arrive Shanghai (D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOn arrival in Shanghai we are met by our tour manager who will accompany us throughout our tour \u2013 transfer to the 4* Ocean Hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Shanghai (B, L, D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf day city tour of Shanghai, China\u0027s largest city whose modern culture dates back to the early 1900\u0027s and is an eclectic mix of East and West, takes in Yu Garden, bustling Nanjing Road and the pristine waterfront Bund \u2013 as night falls, we enjoy an amazing performance of Chinese acrobatics.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Shanghai - Beijing (B, L, D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFly from Shanghai to Beijing \u2013 full day tour of Beijing taking in the expansive Tiananmen Square, the world\u0027s largest public square, the Forbidden City and the Summer Palace, a place of rest and relaxation just minutes from Beijing \u2013 check in to the 4* Guangxi Plaza \u2013 this evening enjoy the marvellous Beijing opera show.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Beijing (B, L, D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EChina\u0027s magnificent Great Wall spans thousands of miles across Northern China and you have ample time to traverse the ancient steps before visiting the famed Ming Tomb Museum \u2013 return to the city to enjoy an impressive Peking duck banquet.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Beijing - Xi\u2019an (B, L, D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVisit the historic Temple of Heaven, widely regarded as the noblest example of religious architecture in China and where emperors came to pray for a bountiful harvest \u2013 short flight to Xi\u2019an and in the afternoon we visit Xian\u2019s ancient city walls \u2013 check in to the 4* Aurum International.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 7 \u2013 Xi\u2019an (B, L, D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EXian is home to the life-sized Terracotta Warriors of Qin Shi Huang, which were designed to protect China\u0027s first emperor even in death and discovered by a farmer in 1974 \u2013 return to Xi\u2019an and visit the Great Wild Goose Pagoda \u2013 this evening, enjoy a special Imperial Dumpling Banquet which is followed by an exciting Dynasty Stage Show.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 8 \u2013 Xi\u2019an - Shanghai (B, L, D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFly back to Shanghai \u2013 check in to the 4* Ocean Hotel \u2013 the rest of the day is free to enjoy Shanghai at your leisure.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 9 \u2013 Shanghai - UK (B)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETransfer to the airport for our direct scheduled flight back home.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3 style=\u0022box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-family: clarendon-urw-extra-narrow, serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(46, 91, 161); font-size: calc(1.275rem \u002B 0.3vw); font-style: normal; text-wrap: balance; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space-collapse: collapse; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\u0022box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; outline: none; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(211, 24, 32); font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\u0022\u003EOPTIONAL YANGTZE RIVER CRUISE ADD ON\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Ch3 data-pm-slice=\u00221 1 []\u0022\u003EDay 9 \u2013 Shanghai - Yichang (B, L, D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInternal flight from Shanghai to Yichang for the cruise \u2013 transfer to our 5* cruise boat for preboarding where we stay for four nights on full board basis.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 10 \u2013 Cruise (B, L, D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESet sail for the magnificent Three Gorges Dam Project, sailing by Gezhouba, the ship lock Xiling Gorge and the five-stage Big Dam Shiplock.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 11 \u2013 Cruise (B, L, D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVisit the Lesser Three Gorges (sometimes called the Daning River) or the Shennongxi Lesser Gorges (sometimes called the Shennong Stream) \u2013 the ship passes through Wu Gorge.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 12 \u2013 Cruise (B, L, D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECruise to Shibaozhai, sailing by the beautiful White King City and Qutang Gorge.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 13 \u2013 Cruise (B, L, D)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDisembark at Chongqing this morning for a city tour \u2013 internal flight to Shanghai \u2013 check in to 4* Ocean Hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EDay 14 \u2013 Shanghai to UK (B)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe transfer back to the airport for our scheduled flight back to the UK.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
